00:17:11,160 --> 00:17:11,990
Yeah!

258
00:17:12,960 --> 00:17:16,477
Avdol might be able to defend
himself for now with his flames.

259
00:17:16,560 --> 00:17:17,390
But not you.

260
00:17:17,473 --> 00:17:19,860
Time to die, Joestar. My stand,

261
00:17:20,060 --> 00:17:21,937
the goddess Bast, is the perfect trap,

262
00:17:22,020 --> 00:17:25,314
and it's also far more powerful
than your hermit purple!

263
00:17:26,320 --> 00:17:29,614
Hope you've said your prayers,
because it's time to die!

264
00:17:38,800 --> 00:17:42,100
Vile woman, my flames will
burn you and your evil alive!

265
00:17:47,820 --> 00:17:51,837
My entire body is being pulled
in another direction! I...

266
00:17:51,920 --> 00:17:52,960
I can't resist!

267
00:18:03,540 --> 00:18:07,017
My flame should be strong enough to
melt the steel without a problem.

268
00:18:07,100 --> 00:18:09,657
But I can't defend
myself from every attack.

269
00:18:09,740 --> 00:18:12,500
This weight is crushing me.

270
00:18:18,260 --> 00:18:20,420
I can't hold it any longer.

271
00:18:21,700 --> 00:18:22,740
Joseph Joestar,

272
00:18:23,140 --> 00:18:28,300
since you're going to die anyway, I can
confess that I find you to be quite a catch.

273
00:18:28,740 --> 00:18:31,557
It's true that I only
knew you for a short time,

274
00:18:31,640 --> 00:18:33,940
but you were so clever and hilarious.

275
00:18:34,420 --> 00:18:38,437
Not to mention your experience would
make younger men green with envy.

276
00:18:38,520 --> 00:18:40,140
Plus, you're very handsome.

277
00:18:41,160 --> 00:18:45,840
I know that you and I are decades apart,
but if I'm being honest with myself,

278
00:18:46,180 --> 00:18:48,356
you would have made a splendid lover.

279
00:18:49,540 --> 00:18:52,320
Well, if that's how you
truly feel about me,

280
00:18:52,740 --> 00:18:55,093
then what do you say you give me a hand?

281
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:59,257
I've seen the light and
realized that your stand is

282
00:18:59,340 --> 00:19:02,097
way more powerful than
mine could ever hope to be!

283
00:19:02,180 --> 00:19:03,640
I can't hold it anymore!

284
00:19:04,340 --> 00:19:05,900
Please, I'm begging you!

285
00:19:06,060 --> 00:19:08,119
You have to turn off the magnetism!

286
00:19:08,340 --> 00:19:10,000
Well, I suppose I could.

287
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:14,057
But no, I don't think I will.

288
00:19:14,140 --> 00:19:16,580
While you are exceptionally handsome,

289
00:19:16,860 --> 00:19:19,197
you're nowhere near as
good-looking as Lord Dio.

290
00:19:19,280 --> 00:19:23,437
So, you're saying that you refuse to
turn off the power no matter what?

291
00:19:23,520 --> 00:19:24,400
Exactly right.

292
00:19:24,720 --> 00:19:26,837
Now, don't you have some dying to do?

293
00:19:26,920 --> 00:19:28,837
Even though I'm grambling to you?

294
00:19:28,920 --> 00:19:30,820
I won't say it again, you idiot.

295
00:19:32,040 --> 00:19:35,922
If that's how you're going to be,
then it's your loss, young lady.

296
00:19:36,320 --> 00:19:37,150
What?!

297
00:19:39,840 --> 00:19:41,080
Shit! Shit!

298
00:19:48,340 --> 00:19:52,517
Weren't you listening to us earlier or
you've been caught between us the whole time?

299
00:19:52,600 --> 00:19:54,817
Magnets are attracted
to each other, you know?

300
00:19:54,900 --> 00:19:57,277
It's too late to do anything about it now,

301
00:19:57,360 --> 00:19:59,757
but getting between us
was your biggest blunder.

302
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,617
There's no way she can hear you, Mr.

303
00:20:01,700 --> 00:20:02,530
Joestar.

304
00:20:02,613 --> 00:20:04,361
She's already lost consciousness.

305
00:20:04,820 --> 00:20:07,037
All the metal and magnetic
forces crushed her,

306
00:20:07,120 --> 00:20:11,591
and it's very likely that she's broken
more than a few bones in the process.

307
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:34,824
All right, why don't we get that
breakfast we were talking about?

308
00:20:35,460 --> 00:20:37,580
Yes, a wonderful idea.

309
00:20:37,900 --> 00:20:40,477
All this running around
has made me rather hungry.

310
00:20:40,560 --> 00:20:43,837
Is it really only 9 a .m.? Damn... you...

311
00:20:43,920 --> 00:20:44,860
pieces of shit!

312
00:20:58,540 --> 00:21:00,520
Those two are taking forever!

313
00:21:01,160 --> 00:21:02,677
As long as they've been in there,

314
00:21:02,760 --> 00:21:06,357
you'd think they were putting on
makeup and dressing for a gala.

315
00:21:06,440 --> 00:21:08,360
And it's almost 9 a .m.

316
00:21:12,620 --> 00:21:15,444
They may have run into
an enemy on the way here.

317
00:21:15,820 --> 00:21:19,080
You think we should see where
they ran off to? I guess.

318
00:21:19,460 --> 00:21:20,400
Good grief.

319
00:21:21,140 --> 00:21:22,500
It's time to go, Iggy.

320
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:26,920
Yeah, yeah, I know you're hungry.

321
00:21:27,120 --> 00:21:28,532
You're not the only one.

322
00:21:28,640 --> 00:21:29,560
Believe me.

323
00:21:38,340 --> 00:21:41,757
Joseph and Avdol are in the middle
of doing battle with Mariah.

324
00:21:41,840 --> 00:21:46,980
So I, Alessi, shall take on the great
honor of killing Jotaro and Polnareff.

325
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:18,140
Thank you.

326
00:22:51,860 --> 00:22:53,900
Thank you.

327
00:23:27,600 --> 00:23:31,517
All right, we're going to take a bath, so
let's take those clothes off, shall we?

328
00:23:31,600 --> 00:23:32,430
Attaboy.

329
00:23:32,513 --> 00:23:33,808
I'll take them off for you.

330
00:23:34,080 --> 00:23:34,910
Attaboy.

331
00:23:34,993 --> 00:23:36,112
I'll clean those wounds.

332
00:23:36,360 --> 00:23:37,190
Attaboy.

333
00:23:37,273 --> 00:23:40,433
Are you positive it's okay
for me to touch you like this?

334
00:23:40,920 --> 00:23:41,750
Attaboy.

335
00:23:41,840 --> 00:23:42,680
You
